EN:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}But last night,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I dined upon a dish
made from freshly ground peanuts,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
spread thickly over a slice of bread.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Garnished with a sweet and tangy
sauce made from a medley of
berries, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Anoche,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} sin ir más lejos, cené un
delicioso plato de pasta con trufa
negra y aceite de oliva virgen.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Además lo acompañé de un queso
con denominación de origen.
¡Qué aroma,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Jedenfalls hab ich mir gestern
allerfeinsten Spargel mit einer
Honig-Senf-Soße zubereitet.
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Dazu ein Glas {{TAG:0005:000E:0000}} und
zum Nachtisch {{TAG:0005:0010:0000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ein kulinarischer Traum!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Ama dün gece{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} taze çekilmiş yer
fıstığından yapılmış bir ezmeyi{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
bir dilim ekmeğe bolca sürüp yedim.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Üzerine de
türlü meyvelerden yapılmış tatlı-ekşi
bir sos gezdirmiştim, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Wow!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} That sounds amazing!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} All
I had last night was a peanut butter
and jelly sandwich.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Waouh !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ça a l'air délicieux !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Moi,
tout ce que je me suis fait hier soir,
c'est un bête sandwich.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Caspitina!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Doveva essere davvero
buono!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Pensa, ieri sera ho cenato
con un misero hamburger.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}But for lunch yesterday,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I layered
fresh tomato sauce and extra-fine
mozzarella over some flat bread.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Comunque sia,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ieri a pranzo ho
mangiato una pasta deliziosa!
Il sugo, claro, l'avevo preparato io!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Ama dün öğlen{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} incecik bir hamurun üstüne
taze domates sosu ve bol
mozzarella koydum.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:002B:}}La chance...! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Ça a l'air super bon !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Quand je pense que moi, tout ce
que j'ai eu, c'est une bête part de
pizza au fromage, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}...{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}But for breakfast yesterday,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I had
two slices of freshly baked bread,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
lightly toasted in a special oven.
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I even spread fine fruit preserves
carefully across one side of each
slice.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} I won't lie—{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}it was exquisite.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Comunque sia,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ieri per colazione
ho mangiato del pane fresco{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} con
della marmellata di pere spaziale.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Al contadino non far sapere{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
quant'è buono il pane con...
la marmellata di pere!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Lucky!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} You eat all kinds of fancy
foods!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} All I had for breakfast was
some toast with jam.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡Vaya!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Comes todo tipo de cosas
"sofistificadas"!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Yo simplemente
desayuné un bocata de jamón.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Trop la chance !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Moi, tout ce que
j'ai eu, c'est deux-trois tartines
avec un peu de confiture.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ne şanslısın!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Hep böyle havalı şeyler
yiyorsun!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}} Ben kahvaltıda reçelli tost
yedim o kadar.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Hey now, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}Don't you
know it's rude to yawn at someone
in the middle of a conversation?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡Pero bueno, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}¿No sabes
que es de mala educación bostezar
en medio de una conversación?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Hey, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}Es gehört sich
nicht, mitten im Gespräch dem
anderen ins Gesicht zu gähnen!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Hey, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}Konuşmanın ortasında
karşındakinin yüzüne esnemenin ayıp
olduğunu bilmiyor musun?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Hey now, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}Don't you
know it's rude to yawn in front of
a lady without excusing yourself? {{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Hey, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}Bir hanımın karşısında
özür dilemeden esnemenin ayıp olduğunu
bilmiyor musun? {{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Je, je, je!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}, ¡ahora tú
tampoco estás demostrando tener
muchos modales que digamos!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Ahí va!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¡Has estornudado sin
taparte la boca!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}Eso tampoco es
de muy buena educación, ¿no?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Du hast dir beim Niesen nicht
die Hand vor den Mund gehalten!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Das ist auch ziemlich unhöflich,
oder? {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡¿Eh?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Ha sido sin querer!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡No me ha dado tiempo de taparme!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Y tengo alergia a muchas cosas...{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡Ha sido culpa tuya!
